cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Spatial Action Review: a dashboard for auditing language-to-action hand-offs in electron microscopy"
message: "If you use this software or its released audit records, please cite the paper below."
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE_ME/spatial-action-review"
abstract: >-
  Interactive visual analytics dashboard for auditing the hand-off between a
  vision-language model's language answer and the point-set action an electron
  microscopy analysis workflow would execute on the same image region. Ships the
  audit records and crop images behind the accompanying paper, reproduces its
  reported values under test, records human routing decisions, and can audit any
  run exported in the same paired answer-action schema.
keywords:
  - visual analytics
  - human-AI oversight
  - multimodal large language models
  - electron microscopy
  - autonomous laboratories
